{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Activate or roll back table search"},"description":"Changes serving search for an exact table version to a qualified generation. action is activate or rollback. expected_active_revision_id and expected_active_generation_id are the observed active coordinates, each null only when absent; stale observations are refused. Returns the activation receipt. The browser asks the person to approve this exact change. Costs no new build. Next: inspect_table_search and query_table to verify actual search behavior. Keep the same idempotency_key when reconciling an uncertain outcome.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"enum":["activate","rollback"],"type":"string"},"expected_active_generation_id":{"anyOf":[{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"expected_active_revision_id":{"anyOf":[{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"generation_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"idempotency_key":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":16,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9._:-]+$","type":"string"},"search_revision_id":{"anyOf":[{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"t